Package: MVPapp
Title: Interactive Platform for Pharmacometric Model Visualization and Simulation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Steve", "Choy", email = "steve.choy@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Jin Gyu", "Kim", role = "aut"),
    person("Matthew", "Fidler", role = "ctb"))
Description: An interactive 'shiny' application for exploring
    pharmacometric models with minimal setup. Users can explore model
    structures, parameters and dosing regimens with 'mrgsolve', and compare
    simulations with observed data. Additional features include parameter
    sensitivity analysis, non-compartmental analysis (NCA), data exploration,
    variability assessment with virtual populations, and optional AI-assisted
    model translation. For design considerations of the app, see Choy et al.
    (2025) <doi:10.1002/psp4.70023>.
